{"seq":3,"slug":"shared-decision-making","title":"研究生 循证医学 — 共同决策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/shared-decision-making","wordCount":2095,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-循证医学-共同决策\">研究生 循证医学 — 共同决策</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>共同决策（Shared Decision-Making, SDM）是循证医学第三支柱——将最佳证据、临床专业判断与患者价值观和偏好有机整合的实践模式。SDM 不是简单的信息告知或患者自主，而是临床医生和患者作为合作伙伴，共同权衡治疗方案的利弊，在充分知情的基础上达成与患者价值观一致的决策。Charles 等人（1997）将 SDM 定义为需要满足三个条件的过程：至少两方参与（医生和患者）、双方共享信息、双方共同达成治疗决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"sdm-的理论模型\">SDM 的理论模型</h3><p><strong>三步模型</strong>（Elwyn et al., 2012）是最广泛使用的 SDM 操作模型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;1. Choice Talk&lt;br/&gt;介绍选择的存在&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2. Option Talk&lt;br/&gt;讨论各方案利弊&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;3. Decision Talk&lt;br/&gt;探索偏好并做出决定&quot;]&#10;    &#10;    A -.-&gt; D[&quot;&#39;有几种合理的选择...&#39;&quot;]&#10;    B -.-&gt; E[&quot;使用决策辅助工具&quot;]&#10;    C -.-&gt; F[&quot;&#39;对您来说最重要的是...&#39;&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"1. Choice Talk&lt;br/&gt;介绍选择的存在\"] --&gt; B[\"2. Option Talk&lt;br/&gt;讨论各方案利弊\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"3. Decision Talk&lt;br/&gt;探索偏好并做出决定\"]\n    \n    A -.-&gt; D[\"'有几种合理的选择...'\"]\n    B -.-&gt; E[\"使用决策辅助工具\"]\n    C -.-&gt; F[\"'对您来说最重要的是...'\"]</pre><p><strong>Choice Talk</strong>（选择对话）：明确告知患者存在多个合理选择，打破&quot;医生单方面决定&quot;的认知框架。关键话术：<em>&quot;对于您的情况，有几种合理的治疗方案，每种方案有不同的优势和风险。在我们一起讨论这些选择之前，我想了解一下什么对您最重要。&quot;</em></p>\n<p><strong>Option Talk</strong>（方案对话）：结构化呈现各方案的获益和风险，使用绝对数字而非相对数字。例如，不说&quot;降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 的风险&quot;，而说&quot;每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 人中减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 例事件&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>Decision Talk</strong>（决策对话）：探索患者的价值观和偏好，帮助患者将个人优先级与方案特征匹配。尊重&quot;偏好敏感性&quot;——在不同患者眼中，同一组利弊数据可能指向不同的最优选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"决策辅助工具\">决策辅助工具</h3><p>决策辅助工具（Decision Aids, DAs）是支持 SDM 的结构化工具，通常以小册子、视频或交互式网站形式呈现，帮助患者理解选择、权衡利弊并明确偏好。</p>\n<p>Cochrane 系统综述（Stacey et al., 2017，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>105</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 105</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">105</span></span></span></span></span> RCTs）发现 DAs 的效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结局指标</th>\n<th>效应</th>\n<th>效应量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>知识水平</td>\n<td>显著提升</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MD = 13.3/100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13.3/100</span></span></span></span></span> 分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确风险感知</td>\n<td>显著改善</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.07</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = 2.07</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.07</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策冲突</td>\n<td>显著降低</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>9.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MD = -9.3/100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">9.3/100</span></span></span></span></span> 分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价值观一致性</td>\n<td>显著提高</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦虑水平</td>\n<td>无显著变化</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择有创/保守方案</td>\n<td>减少选择有创方案</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.86</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = 0.86</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.86</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>IPDAS（International Patient Decision Aid Standards）为 DAs 的开发和质量评价提供了标准：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DA 质量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>信息平衡性</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>概率呈现方式</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>价值观澄清方法</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>可读性</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DA 质量} = f(\\text{信息平衡性}, \\text{概率呈现方式}, \\text{价值观澄清方法}, \\text{可读性})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">质量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">信息平衡性</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">概率呈现方式</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价值观澄清方法</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可读性</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"风险沟通的循证方法\">风险沟通的循证方法</h3><p>风险沟通是 SDM 的技术核心。研究表明不同呈现方式对患者理解和决策的影响差异巨大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>呈现方式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>认知偏差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相对风险降低</td>\n<td>&quot;降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 风险&quot;</td>\n<td>夸大获益感知（框架效应）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对风险降低</td>\n<td>&quot;每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 人减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 例&quot;</td>\n<td>较准确但可能低估获益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要治疗人数 NNT</td>\n<td>&quot;治疗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 人可预防 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 例&quot;</td>\n<td>直观但需要注意时间框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然频率</td>\n<td>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 人中有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 人发生&quot;</td>\n<td>最易理解的概率呈现方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图形化呈现</td>\n<td>图标阵列（Icon Array）</td>\n<td>降低分数运算的认知负荷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最佳实践推荐使用<strong>自然频率</strong>结合<strong>图标阵列</strong>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 个小人图标中标记受影响的个体），同时呈现有治疗和无治疗两种情景的绝对数字。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sdm-的适用场景\">SDM 的适用场景</h3><p>SDM 并非在所有临床情境中同等适用。&quot;偏好敏感性&quot;（Preference Sensitivity）是判断 SDM 必要性的关键维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景类型</th>\n<th>偏好敏感性</th>\n<th>SDM 需求</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>明确获益</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>急性心梗的急诊 PCI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利弊接近</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>早期前列腺癌（手术 vs. 监测）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价值观依赖</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>临终关怀方式选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性大</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>新证据不充分的治疗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Wennberg 将很大比例的医疗决策归类为&quot;偏好敏感型&quot;，估计约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 的外科手术受地区实践风格而非患者偏好驱动（&quot;不恰当的临床变异&quot;）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sdm-的测量\">SDM 的测量</h3><p>测量 SDM 的质量和程度是研究和质量改进的基础：</p>\n<p><strong>OPTION Scale</strong>（Observing Patient Involvement in Decision-Making）：由外部观察者对医患对话进行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 条目评分（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span></span> 分），评估医生在多大程度上将患者纳入决策过程。</p>\n<p><strong>CollaboRATE</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 条目患者自报量表，评估患者感知的 SDM 程度。问题简短：(1) 是否解释了健康问题？(2) 是否倾听了最重要的关注？(3) 是否考虑了偏好？每项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 分。</p>\n<p><strong>决策冲突量表</strong>（Decisional Conflict Scale, DCS）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 条目，评估患者在决策后的不确定感、信息不足感和价值观不明确感。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DCS &lt; 25/100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25/100</span></span></span></span></span> 表示可接受的决策冲突水平。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sdm-的实施障碍与促进因素\">SDM 的实施障碍与促进因素</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>障碍</th>\n<th>层面</th>\n<th>应对策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间不足</td>\n<td>系统</td>\n<td>将 SDM 整合入标准诊疗流程，先发 DA 后讨论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认为患者不想参与</td>\n<td>医生认知</td>\n<td>证据显示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 患者希望参与，但不一定希望最终决定权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康素养低</td>\n<td>患者</td>\n<td>使用视觉化工具、简明语言、回授法（Teach-Back）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律责任担忧</td>\n<td>系统</td>\n<td>SDM 文档化实际上增强法律保护（知情同意的实质化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺乏 DA 工具</td>\n<td>资源</td>\n<td>利用 Ottawa Decision Aid Library 等现有资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"sdm-在特殊场景中的应用\">SDM 在特殊场景中的应用</h3><p><strong>危重症/急诊</strong>：时间紧迫不意味着排除 SDM——最佳利益原则（当患者无法参与时）与预先指示（Advance Directives）是该场景下的 SDM 替代形式。</p>\n<p><strong>儿科</strong>：三方模型（Triad Model）纳入儿童、父母和医生，根据儿童年龄和认知发展调整参与程度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 岁的儿童通常应有实质性参与。</p>\n<p><strong>精神疾病</strong>：能力评估（Capacity Assessment）是前提。即使在决策能力受限的情况下，最大化患者参与仍是伦理要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span></span></span></span></span> 岁男性被诊断为局限性前列腺癌（Gleason <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3+4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PSA = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> ng/mL）。选项包括根治性前列腺切除术、放射治疗和主动监测。请用 Elwyn 三步模型设计一段 SDM 对话，并说明你会使用什么数据呈现方式帮助患者理解各方案的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 年肿瘤特异性死亡率、尿失禁和性功能障碍风险。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某医院引入了一套心房颤动抗凝治疗的决策辅助工具。实施 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个月后，数据显示 DA 使用率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span></span></span></span></span>，使用 DA 的患者 DCS 显著低于未使用者（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span></span></span></span></span> vs. <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>38</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">38</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P &lt; 0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span>），但 OPTION 评分仅从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18/48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18/48</span></span></span></span></span> 提高到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22/48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22/48</span></span></span></span></span>。请解读这些数据，并提出提高 DA 使用率和 SDM 质量的改进策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么使用相对风险降低（&quot;降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span> 的心脏病风险&quot;）比使用绝对风险降低（&quot;每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span></span> 人减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 例&quot;）更容易导致患者高估治疗获益？请从认知心理学的框架效应角度解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在资源有限的基层医疗机构中，平均每位患者的诊疗时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟。请设计一个可行的 SDM 实施方案，包括预访问准备、诊间对话结构和随访确认。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Elwyn, G. et al. (2012)</strong>：&quot;Shared Decision Making: A Model for Clinical Practice&quot;，Journal of General Internal Medicine——三步模型的原始论文</li>\n<li><strong>Stacey, D. et al. (2017)</strong>：&quot;Decision Aids for People Facing Health Treatment or Screening Decisions&quot;，Cochrane Database——DAs 效果的 Cochrane 综述</li>\n<li><strong>Gigerenzer, G. et al. (2007)</strong>：&quot;Helping Doctors and Patients Make Sense of Health Statistics&quot;，Psychological Science in the Public Interest——风险沟通的认知科学基础</li>\n<li><strong>Stiggelbout, A.M. et al. (2015)</strong>：&quot;Shared Decision Making: Concepts, Evidence, and Practice&quot;，Patient Education and Counseling——SDM 综合综述</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>共同决策将循证医学从&quot;基于证据的医生决策&quot;提升为&quot;基于证据的医患协作决策&quot;，真正实现了以患者为中心的循证实践。三步模型提供了清晰的操作框架，决策辅助工具和循证风险沟通技术为 SDM 提供了实用工具。在偏好敏感型决策中，SDM 不仅改善了决策质量和患者满意度，还减少了不必要的手术和治疗，具有同时提升医疗质量和控制成本的双重价值。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 循证医学 — 共同决策","id":"研究生-循证医学-共同决策"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"SDM 的理论模型","id":"sdm-的理论模型"},{"level":3,"text":"决策辅助工具","id":"决策辅助工具"},{"level":3,"text":"风险沟通的循证方法","id":"风险沟通的循证方法"},{"level":3,"text":"SDM 的适用场景","id":"sdm-的适用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"SDM 的测量","id":"sdm-的测量"},{"level":3,"text":"SDM 的实施障碍与促进因素","id":"sdm-的实施障碍与促进因素"},{"level":3,"text":"SDM 在特殊场景中的应用","id":"sdm-在特殊场景中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 循证医学 — 实施科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/evidence-based-medicine/implementation/implementation-science"},"next":null}